          <div class="project-card-content">
            <div class="project-card-main">
              <div class="project-card-text">
                <h3 class="project-card-title">MedTracker</h3>
                <p class="project-card-impact">Intelligent healthcare record management system</p>
              </div>
              <button class="project-card-toggle" aria-label="Expand project details" aria-expanded="false">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                  <path d="M4 6L8 10L12 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card-badges">
              <span class="project-badge">[ Next.js ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Express.js ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ MongoDB ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Redis ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ JWT ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ OAuth 2.0 ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Cloudinary ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Multer ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Vitest ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ Supertest ]</span>
              <span class="project-badge">[ CI/CD ]</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card-expanded">
              <div class="project-card-details">
                <div class="project-detail-block">
                  <span class="project-detail-label">Overview</span>
                  <p>Engineered a multi-tier healthcare records platform with a Next.js client, Express REST API (36 endpoints, 7 MongoDB models), and dual JWT + Google OAuth 2.0 authentication for secure patient data management.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="project-detail-block">
                  <span class="project-detail-label">Key Features</span>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Cache-aside layer with Redis (30-day TTL) in front of MongoDB as source of truth — AI report analysis runs exactly once per record</li>
                    <li>Automatic failover from LLaMA to Gemini with fail-open behavior for uninterrupted document processing</li>
                    <li>Cloudinary media storage with Multer upload handling for medical documents and images</li>
                    <li>21 automated tests (Vitest, Supertest, in-memory MongoDB) integrated into GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline gating releases</li>
                    <li>JWT + Google OAuth 2.0 dual authentication with secure session management</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="project-detail-block">
                  <span class="project-detail-label">Architecture</span>
                  <p>Next.js frontend communicating with Express REST APIs backed by MongoDB. Redis cache-aside pattern (30-day TTL) reduces redundant AI inference. Dual-model extraction pipeline (LLaMA primary, Gemini fallback) with structured JSON output. CI/CD enforces test coverage on every push.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="project-detail-block">
                  <span class="project-detail-label">Impact</span>
                  <p class="project-card-metric">36 REST endpoints · 7 MongoDB models · Redis cache-aside (30-day TTL) · 21 automated tests · GitHub Actions CI/CD · Dual JWT/OAuth 2.0 auth · Redundant AI document processing</p>
                </div>
              </div>
